<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/00c231e0084f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1364] GM’s Cruise vehicles have been operating autonomously in San Francisco at night, giving rides to employees around the city." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1364" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0433d1063fe5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "As Cruise spokesperson Aaron Mclear explained to The Verge, the autonomous vehicle didn’t drive away to escape from police — it was trying to find a safer location to pull over in, a move that most human drivers can’t get away with so easily." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1365" .

